Build exactly one stable P000001... entry per canonical logical source occurrence in labeled_occurrences.json with fields: occurrence_id, source_component, source_order, reported_p, result_label, outcome, predictor_or_contrast, population, analysis_method, model_specification, adjustment_context, table_section, source_location, evidence_text, label_status (supported/partial/unresolved), plus optional source_variant_matches, regression_covariate_family, reference_level, effect_estimate, confidence_interval. Every R-vector p must refer to a registry P ID; preserve ambiguity explicitly. Row label alone is not enough for Cox: endpoint + cohort + univariable/multivariable + matched/unmatched + covariate level are necessary to distinguish results. Verify per-source counts and no duplicated P IDs before stage 06.

