DEFINITIONS AND COUNTING ONTOLOGY
- Printed occurrence P: one visible p-value or statistical-significance mark at one LOGICAL reporting location; a copied PDF/HTML rendering of the same table cell is one occurrence, not two. Narrative/abstract repeats and figure marks are separate reported locations.
