### Late-day evaluation — two real article extractions and the validation milestone {.unlisted}

The same-day engineering loop progressed from **coverage regression → measured PDF source geometry → dedicated statistical identity decisions → independent machine validation → two article proposals passing structural checks**. These are **model-proposed research records**, not a fully human-reviewed benchmark. Neither an R script's physical presence nor a machine PASS constitutes R execution or source-level scientific verification.

<details class="oi-callout oi-version-callout oi-subentry">
