The relatively compact article is a useful usability/accuracy pilot for the same code and contract; it is **not** a special article hardwired into START_HERE. **At this initial model-output checkpoint**, its 13 R identities had not yet been human-reviewed; the subsequent reviewer verification of Modules 01–02 is recorded in the late-day update below.

