Run source fidelity, raw-source-candidate coverage by file/page/section,
excluded/unresolved candidate dispositions, row count, the separate per-P
statistical-identity decision/candidate-pair audit, P/R cardinality, ID/FK,
model-term/formula, six-R-file consistency, source reconciliation, schema and
provenance checks. The final summary MUST distinguish source coverage from
P-to-R referential integrity and report all per-format observed counts and
unscanned regions. LOCAL legacy validators in the original Shiny package
cannot validate the new schema 3.0; label checks not run honestly. Produce
