022. article_id — Article identifier linking study-design and sample-size metadata.
023. study_design — Design as described and supportable from article methods (not inferred from field names).
024. n_subjects_enrolled — Number enrolled, count persons not observations
025. n_subjects_analyzed — Number of persons analyzed; do not infer from enrollment
026. n_observations_enrolled — Number of observations, lesions, events or specimens, when distinct
027. observation_unit — Unit represented by an observation
028. randomization_unit — Unit randomized, if applicable
029. analysis_unit — Unit of statistical analysis
030. n_clusters — Number of higher-level clusters, if documented
031. sample_size_calculation_reported — Whether sample size or power planning was reported
