The reviewer **copies each generated R tribble back into the model, checks it against the supplied publication evidence, edits the R source, and then activates that scope’s `qc_confirm()` call**. The untouched proposal remains retained separately. Moving a file into `qc/human_verified/` without valid scoped confirmation is not approval.

