- `OIP31_STAGE2_SCIENTIFIC_DICTIONARY_DRAFT1_2026-10-21.html` — the complete searchable four-column dictionary.
- `OIP31_STAGE2_SCIENTIFIC_DICTIONARY_DRAFT1_2026-10-21_HANDOFF_SCHEMATIC.html` — visual map of Stage I identities flowing to outcomes, SPEC/FIT, questions and claims.
- Corresponding `.R`, `.csv`, and `LEGACY152_CROSSWALK.csv` — editable dictionary and historical mapping.
- `OIP31_STAGE2_SCIENTIFIC_DICTIONARY_DRAFT1_2026-10-21_REVIEW_PACKAGE.zip` — contemporaneous versioned review package.

